{"src":"01-raw/2025-09-25/data/label_34.json","id":6637,"nhanesId":"","bundleName":"","fullName":"Anabolic Switch Multi-Phasic Anabolic Creatine","brandName":"MRI","brandIpSymbol":"™","upcSku":"6 33012 62021 0","productVersionCode":"Rev. 092707","pdf":"","thumbnail":"","servingsPerContainer":"20","hasOuterCarton":false,"percentDvFootnote":"Percent Daily Values are based on a 2,000 calorie diet","labelRelationships":[],"contacts":[{"contactId":2498,"text":"MANUFACTURED FOR & DISTRIBUTED BY","types":["Manufacturer","Distributor"],"contactDetails":{"src":"01-raw/2025-09-25/data/contact_1.json","id":2498,"name":"MRI Medical Research Institute ","streetAddress":"","city":"San Francisco","state":"CA","country":"","zipCode":"94107","phoneNumber":"1.888.448.4246","email":"","webAddress":"www.mri-performance.com"}}],"netContents":[{"order":1,"quantity":2,"unit":"lb","display":"2 lb"},{"order":2,"quantity":907,"unit":"g","display":"907 g"}],"physicalState":{"langualCode":"E0162","langualCodeDescription":"Powder"},"servingSizes":[{"order":1,"minQuantity":45,"maxQuantity":45,"minDailyServings":2,"maxDailyServings":2,"unit":"Gram(s)","notes":"3 scoops","inSFB":true}],"targetGroups":["Women (not pregnant or lactating)","Adult Male (18-50 Years)"],"productType":{"langualCode":"A1325","langualCodeDescription":"Other Combinations"},"statements":[{"type":"FDA Statement of Identity","notes":"DIETARY SUPPLEMENT"},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"DIRECTIONS:\nTake 2 servings daily, dosed as follows:\nON TRAINING DAYS: Take one serving BEFORE your workout and the second serving AFTER your workout.\nON NON-TRAINING DAYS: Take one serving in the morning and the second serving 12 hours later.\nFOR BEST RESULTS: Cycle Anabolic Switch \"ON\" for 4 weeks and \"OFF\" for 2 weeks."},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"NOTE: Do not take ester creatine (such as CE2(R)) with Anabolic Switch during the \"ON\" cycle. It is recommended to take CE2 during the \"OFF\" cycle."},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"PREPARATION: Mix 1 serving (3 scoops) of Anabolic Switch in 8 oz. of cold water. Consume immediately."},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"KEEP OUT OF THE REACH OF CHILDREN."},{"type":"FDA Disclaimer Statement","notes":"* THESE STATEMENTS HAVE NOT BEEN EVALUATED BY THE FOOD AND DRUG ADMINISTRATION. THIS PRODUCT IS NOT INTENDED TO DIAGNOSE, TREAT, CURE OR PREVENT ANY DISEASE."},{"type":"Storage","notes":"PROTECT FROM LIGHT AND MOISTURE."},{"type":"Storage","notes":"STORE AT 59-86°F (15-30°C)."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"* Use in conjunction with your exercise routine. ** Graphic representation of proposed PK profile."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Anabolic Switch precisely \"links\" the anabolic phase of all 7 types of creatine (Cr1-Cr7) found in its fomulation. You'll notice how at the precise point one creatine starts to fade, the next creatine begins to spike. This new multi-phasic \"Sequential Wave\" technology keeps your body anabolic all day long."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"EXTENDING YOUR TIME IN ANABOLISM\nMRI's New Creatine \"Sequential Wave\" Technology\nCREATINE'S ANABOLIC PHASE (CAP) (chart)\nANABOLIC THRESHOLD\nCr1     Cr2     Cr3     Cr4     Cr5     Cr6     Cr7"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"FAST ACTING, LONG LASTING\nAbabolic Switch comes on fast and lasts all day long. In fact, your body experiences the first \"anabolic wave\" within minutes after dosing, as creatine #1 releases fully into your blood stream. Anabolic Switch then maintains the anabolic rush throughout the day as each successive form of creatine enters the blood stream in precisely timed intervals.*"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"IT'S YOUR BODY. MAKE THE ANABOLIC SWITCH."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"MULTI-PHASIC ANABOLIC CREATINE*"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"NEW AND IMPROVED!"},{"type":"General: Product/Version Code","notes":"Rev. 092707"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"THE ADVANTAGE\nAnabolic Switch is the first and only bona fide anabolic creatine. Unlike regular creatines that only enhance strength, Anabolic Switch keeps your body in power anabolism, in addition to ramping up strength, all day long. Plus, you get all 8 essential aminos necessary for complete anabolism.^*"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"The Ultimate Size Formula*\nFast-Acting Anabolic Creatine*\nAll Day Anabolism*\nEmploys 7 Forms of Creatine\nOnly 1 Gran of Sugar"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"U.S. PATENT PENDING"},{"type":"Precautions re: Pregnant or Nursing or Prescription Medications","notes":"WARNING: Do not use if you are pregnant, nursing, at risk for or suffer from renal (kidney) or hepatic (liver) dysfunction. Do not use if you suffer from diabetes or if you are prone to hyperglycemia or hypoglycemia. Do not use if you have been prescribed and are taking Disulfiram (Antabuse), or if you have a known hypersensitivity to any of the components in creatine or ethyl alcohol. Not intended for use by individuals under the age of 18 years. Maintain an adequate state of hydration during use. If you experience a skin rash or any other allergic reaction, discontinue use and consult a physician."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"(C) 2007, MRI, Inc."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"CarnoSyn(R) is a registered trademark of NAI, Inc. USA Patents: 5,965,596; 6,172,098B1; 6,426,361B2"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"CONTAINS AnaMAX-24(TM)\n\"Sequential Wave\" Delivery Technology"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"THE SCIENCE\nAnabolic Switch employs AnaMax-24(TM), the new anabolic \"Sequential Wave\" delivery technology. Anabolic Switch connects - in series - the anabolic phase of all 7 types of creatine found in its formulation. That's how Anabolic Switch extends your body's Total Time in Anabolism (TTA). With Anabolic Switch, you get maximum gains in size and strength.^*"},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"CarnoSyn(r) Carnitine Synthesizer"},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"SUGAR INDEPENDENT S.I.A. ABSORPTION TECHNOLOGY"}],"claims":[{"langualCode":"P0115","langualCodeDescription":"All Other"},{"langualCode":"P0265","langualCodeDescription":"Structure/Function"}],"events":[{"date":"2012-03-23","type":"Date entered into DSLD"}],"userGroups":[{"dailyValueTargetGroupName":"Adults and children 4 or more years of age","langualCode":"P0250","langualCodeDescription":"Adults and Children 4 years and above"}],"ingredientRows":[{"order":1,"ingredientId":284519,"description":null,"notes":null,"quantity":[{"servingSizeOrder":1,"servingSizeQuantity":45,"operator":"=","quantity":130,"unit":"{Calories}","dailyValueTargetGroup":[],"servingSizeUnit":"Gram(s)"}],"nestedRows":[],"name":"Calories","category":"other","ingredientGroup":"Calories","uniiCode":"1","alternateNames":[],"forms":[]},{"order":2,"ingredientId":284522,"description":null,"notes":null,"quantity":[{"servingSizeOrder":1,"servingSizeQuantity":45,"operator":"=","quantity":0,"unit":"{Calories}","dailyValueTargetGroup":[],"servingSizeUnit":"Gram(s)"}],"nestedRows":[],"name":"Calories from Fat","category":"other","ingredientGroup":"Calories","uniiCode":"1","alternateNames":[],"forms":[]},{"order":3,"ingredientId":18586,"description":null,"notes":null,"quantity":[{"servingSizeOrder":1,"servingSizeQuantity":45,"operator":"=","quantity":0,"unit":"g","dailyValueTargetGroup":[{"name":"Adults and children 4 or more years of age","operator":"=","percent":0,"footnote":null}],"servingSizeUnit":"Gram(s)"}],"nestedRows":[],"name":"Total Fat","category":"fat","ingredientGroup":"Fat (unspecified)","uniiCode":null,"alternateNames":[],